Project  𝄀
  ->  Sort  𝄀
        Sort Key: #[0,0] INTERNAL  𝄀
        Limit: 3  𝄀
        ->  Join  𝄀
              Join Type: INNER  𝄀
              Join Cond: (#[0,0] = docs.id)  𝄀
              ->  Join  𝄀
                    Join Type: SEMI  𝄀
                    Join Cond: (#[0,0] = docs.id)  𝄀
                    Runtime Filter Build: #[10,0]  𝄀
                    ->  Vector Index Scan on idx [l2_distance]  𝄀
                          Runtime Filter Probe: #[8,0]  𝄀
                          Vector Index: idx, Metric: l2_distance, Candidate Limit: 3, NProbe: 8  𝄀
                    ->  Table Scan on ivf_persisted_filter_topk.docs  𝄀
                          Filter Cond: (docs.delete_flag IS NULL), (docs.content_type IS NULL)  𝄀
              ->  Table Scan on ivf_persisted_filter_topk.docs  𝄀
                    Filter Cond: (docs.delete_flag IS NULL), (docs.content_type IS NULL)
explain select id,payload,l2_distance(v,'[0,0,0,0]') as dist from docs
where delete_flag is null and content_type is null
order by dist limit 3 by rank with option 'mode=force';
